  "details": "At midnight on June 2nd, after the 1204 to 1205 update, the controller stopped working in desktop mode.\nThere was a similar post in the steam community, but I couldn't find a solution, and there were similar and unresolved posts within the Discord server.\nIf it is a problem, I would like to ask you to fix it.\nSorry for the immature English.\nTemplate:\n\nVRChat Version:1205\n\nDescription of the bug:XBOX controller etc. does not work in desktop mode\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):Start in desktop mod\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):do not have",
